---
title: Crispy Rosemary Fingerlings
course: side
servings: 4
time_active: 5
time_total: 35
leftovers: good
tags: [weeknight]
pairs: [pork-chops-with-peach-salsa]
---

Heat the oven to 425°F.

Halve @fingerling potatoes{1.5%lb} lengthwise. Toss with @olive oil{2%tbsp}, @salt, @black pepper{}, @garlic{3%cloves}(smashed), and @rosemary{3%sprigs}(or thyme).

Spread cut-side down on a #sheet pan{} and roast until golden and crisp, ~{25-30%minutes}.

> With the peach salsa, toss the hot potatoes with a spoonful of the salsa's juices.
